{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 55, :comments ["<b>For the children of Israel are My slaves.</b> And not the slaves of Esav." "<b>I am YHWH your Elohim.</b> And it is written further: ״לא תעשו לכם אלילים״ — and what does this have to do here? Rather, it says ״אני״ — I who come to give a reason for why we are redeemed without fulfillment of the commandments, for after all they fulfilled the utterance ״לא יהיה לך אלהים אחרים״."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:41.974505407Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}